{
 "id": "pep04",
 "title": "The Playgroup",
 "source": "manual-en-srt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 2.601,
   "end": 4.337,
   "en": "I'm Peppa Pig.",
   "i": 1,
   "zh": "我是佩奇。"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.37,
   "end": 7.106,
   "en": "This is my little brother George.",
   "i": 2,
   "zh": "这是我的弟弟乔治。"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.14,
   "end": 9.141,
   "en": "This is Mummy Pig.",
   "i": 3,
   "zh": "这是猪妈妈。"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.175,
   "end": 11.577,
   "en": "And this is Daddy Pig.",
   "i": 4,
   "zh": "这是猪爸爸。"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.079,
   "end": 15.015,
   "en": "Peppa Pig.",
   "i": 5,
   "zh": "小猪佩奇。"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.825,
   "end": 28.826,
   "en": "Peppa and George are going to the playgroup.",
   "i": 6,
   "zh": "佩奇和乔治要去幼儿园。"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.826,
   "end": 30.463,
   "en": "It's George's first day.",
   "i": 7,
   "zh": "今天是乔治第一天去。"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.496,
   "end": 34.667,
   "en": "George, are you looking forward to the playgroup?",
   "i": 8,
   "zh": "乔治，你期待去幼儿园吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.7,
   "end": 40.139,
   "en": "Daddy, maybe George is too small to go to my playgroup!",
   "i": 9,
   "zh": "爸爸，乔治可能太小了，还不能去我的幼儿园！"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.172,
   "end": 42.609,
   "en": "He'll be fine, Peppa.",
   "i": 10,
   "zh": "他会没事的，佩奇。"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.642,
   "end": 46.278,
   "en": "There'll be you and Mr. Dinosaur there to keep him company.",
   "i": 11,
   "zh": "有你和恐龙先生陪着他呢。"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.312,
   "end": 47.747,
   "en": "Grr!",
   "i": 12,
   "zh": "吼！"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.78,
   "end": 48.627,
   "en": "Dinosaur!",
   "i": 13,
   "zh": "恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.627,
   "end": 52.485,
   "en": "But I want to play with the big children.",
   "i": 14,
   "zh": "可是我想和大孩子一起玩。"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.518,
   "end": 55.255,
   "en": "Not George and his toy dinosaur.",
   "i": 15,
   "zh": "不想带乔治和他的玩具恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.288,
   "end": 56.034,
   "en": "Oh, dear.",
   "i": 16,
   "zh": "哦，天哪。"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.034,
   "end": 60.093,
   "en": "Peppa doesn't want George to go to her playgroup.",
   "i": 17,
   "zh": "佩奇不想让乔治去她的幼儿园。"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.098,
   "end": 67.434,
   "en": "We're here.",
   "i": 18,
   "zh": "我们到了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.467,
   "end": 71.67,
   "en": "Daddy, are you sure George is big enough?",
   "i": 19,
   "zh": "爸爸，你确定乔治够大了吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.704,
   "end": 73.706,
   "en": "He'll be fine.",
   "i": 20,
   "zh": "他会没事的。"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.941,
   "end": 79.913,
   "en": "All right, he can come.",
   "i": 21,
   "zh": "好吧，他可以来。"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.946,
   "end": 81.781,
   "en": "Bye-bye!",
   "i": 22,
   "zh": "再见！"
  },
  {
   "start": 90.056,
   "end": 93.827,
   "en": "Madam Gazelle looks after the children at the playgroup.",
   "i": 23,
   "zh": "羚羊夫人在幼儿园照看孩子们。"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.86,
   "end": 96.162,
   "en": "Hello!",
   "i": 24,
   "zh": "你好！"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.195,
   "end": 98.677,
   "en": "This is my little brother...",
   "i": 25,
   "zh": "这是我的弟弟……"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.677,
   "end": 99.298,
   "en": "George.",
   "i": 26,
   "zh": "乔治。"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.331,
   "end": 102.201,
   "en": "Hello, George!",
   "i": 27,
   "zh": "你好，乔治！"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.475,
   "end": 112.908,
   "en": "I wish I had a little brother like George.",
   "i": 28,
   "zh": "我真希望也有个像乔治这样的弟弟。"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.908,
   "end": 113.48,
   "en": "Really?",
   "i": 29,
   "zh": "真的吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.513,
   "end": 114.283,
   "en": "Hello.",
   "i": 30,
   "zh": "你好。"
  },
  {
   "start": 114.283,
   "end": 116.08,
   "en": "I'm Danny Dog.",
   "i": 31,
   "zh": "我是小狗丹尼。"
  },
  {
   "start": 116.08,
   "end": 118.518,
   "en": "Is that a dinosaur?",
   "i": 32,
   "zh": "那是恐龙吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.551,
   "end": 121.12,
   "en": "It's just a toy dinosaur.",
   "i": 33,
   "zh": "那只是个玩具恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 121.154,
   "end": 122.037,
   "en": "Grr!",
   "i": 34,
   "zh": "吼！"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.037,
   "end": 124.023,
   "en": "Dinosaur.",
   "i": 35,
   "zh": "恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.056,
   "end": 126.792,
   "en": "Brilliant!",
   "i": 36,
   "zh": "太棒了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.826,
   "end": 128.443,
   "en": "Dinosaur.",
   "i": 37,
   "zh": "恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 128.443,
   "end": 129.161,
   "en": "Grr!",
   "i": 38,
   "zh": "吼！"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.565,
   "end": 134.297,
   "en": "Dinosaur.",
   "i": 39,
   "zh": "恐龙。"
  },
  {
   "start": 134.297,
   "end": 135.067,
   "en": "Grr!",
   "i": 40,
   "zh": "吼！"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.1,
   "end": 135.689,
   "en": "Aah!",
   "i": 41,
   "zh": "啊！"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.689,
   "end": 137.603,
   "en": "Really scary!",
   "i": 42,
   "zh": "真吓人！"
  },
  {
   "start": 137.636,
   "end": 141.507,
   "en": "That's brilliant!",
   "i": 43,
   "zh": "太棒了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 141.54,
   "end": 143.935,
   "en": "George is my brother.",
   "i": 44,
   "zh": "乔治是我的弟弟。"
  },
  {
   "start": 143.935,
   "end": 145.645,
   "en": "He's brilliant.",
   "i": 45,
   "zh": "他很棒。"
  },
  {
   "start": 146.912,
   "end": 149.849,
   "en": "Peppa is proud of her little brother George.",
   "i": 46,
   "zh": "佩奇为她的弟弟乔治感到骄傲。"
  },
  {
   "start": 153.552,
   "end": 157.223,
   "en": "Shall we show George how we paint pictures?",
   "i": 47,
   "zh": "我们教乔治画画好吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 157.256,
   "end": 160.159,
   "en": "George is not very good at painting.",
   "i": 48,
   "zh": "乔治不太会画画。"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.193,
   "end": 162.261,
   "en": "Well, maybe you could help him.",
   "i": 49,
   "zh": "那你可以帮帮他呀。"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.294,
   "end": 162.969,
   "en": "Yes!",
   "i": 50,
   "zh": "好！"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.969,
   "end": 165.33,
   "en": "I'm very good!",
   "i": 51,
   "zh": "我很会画！"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.364,
   "end": 168.367,
   "en": "I will show him how to paint a flower.",
   "i": 52,
   "zh": "我来教他画一朵花。"
  },
  {
   "start": 168.401,
   "end": 173.239,
   "en": "George, today I'm going to teach you how to paint a flower.",
   "i": 53,
   "zh": "乔治，今天我来教你画一朵花。"
  },
  {
   "start": 175.307,
   "end": 177.911,
   "en": "First you paint a big circle.",
   "i": 54,
   "zh": "先画一个大圆圈。"
  },
  {
   "start": 181.514,
   "end": 186.085,
   "en": "No, George, that's the wrong color.",
   "i": 55,
   "zh": "不行，乔治，颜色不对。"
  },
  {
   "start": 186.118,
   "end": 188.922,
   "en": "Now you paint the flower's petals.",
   "i": 56,
   "zh": "现在画花瓣。"
  },
  {
   "start": 191.124,
   "end": 192.424,
   "en": "George!",
   "i": 57,
   "zh": "乔治！"
  },
  {
   "start": 192.458,
   "end": 195.461,
   "en": "That's the wrong shape.",
   "i": 58,
   "zh": "形状不对。"
  },
  {
   "start": 195.494,
   "end": 198.998,
   "en": "Now you paint the stalk and the leaves.",
   "i": 59,
   "zh": "现在画花茎和叶子。"
  },
  {
   "start": 199.999,
   "end": 202.502,
   "en": "Perfect!",
   "i": 60,
   "zh": "完美！"
  },
  {
   "start": 205.371,
   "end": 206.003,
   "en": "George!",
   "i": 61,
   "zh": "乔治！"
  },
  {
   "start": 206.003,
   "end": 208.441,
   "en": "You have done it all wrong!",
   "i": 62,
   "zh": "你全都画错了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 210.142,
   "end": 212.763,
   "en": "Now, what do we have here?",
   "i": 63,
   "zh": "咦，这是什么呀？"
  },
  {
   "start": 212.763,
   "end": 214.981,
   "en": "I've painted a flower!",
   "i": 64,
   "zh": "我画了一朵花！"
  },
  {
   "start": 215.014,
   "end": 217.35,
   "en": "That's very good, Peppa.",
   "i": 65,
   "zh": "画得真好，佩奇。"
  },
  {
   "start": 217.383,
   "end": 221.553,
   "en": "And George has painted a dinosaur!",
   "i": 66,
   "zh": "乔治画了一只恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 221.587,
   "end": 222.573,
   "en": "Grr!",
   "i": 67,
   "zh": "吼！"
  },
  {
   "start": 222.573,
   "end": 224.791,
   "en": "Dinosaur!",
   "i": 68,
   "zh": "恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 226.358,
   "end": 230.028,
   "en": "Brilliant!",
   "i": 69,
   "zh": "太棒了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 230.062,
   "end": 234.834,
   "en": "I think George and Peppa's pictures should go on the wall.",
   "i": 70,
   "zh": "我觉得乔治和佩奇的画应该挂到墙上。"
  },
  {
   "start": 234.867,
   "end": 236.803,
   "en": "Hooray!",
   "i": 71,
   "zh": "好耶！"
  },
  {
   "start": 238.371,
   "end": 242.775,
   "en": "Peppa, you must be very proud of your little brother.",
   "i": 72,
   "zh": "佩奇，你一定很为弟弟骄傲。"
  },
  {
   "start": 242.809,
   "end": 245.444,
   "en": "Yes, I am!",
   "i": 73,
   "zh": "是的！"
  },
  {
   "start": 248.581,
   "end": 252.017,
   "en": "It is home time, and the children's parents are here to pick them up.",
   "i": 74,
   "zh": "放学时间到了，孩子们的家长来接他们了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 252.051,
   "end": 254.62,
   "en": "Can George come next time?",
   "i": 75,
   "zh": "乔治下次还能来吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 254.653,
   "end": 255.002,
   "en": "Yes.",
   "i": 76,
   "zh": "可以。"
  },
  {
   "start": 255.002,
   "end": 258.758,
   "en": "And he can paint us another lovely picture.",
   "i": 77,
   "zh": "他还可以再给我们画一张好看的画。"
  },
  {
   "start": 258.791,
   "end": 262.127,
   "en": "And what will you paint next time, George?",
   "i": 78,
   "zh": "乔治，你下次想画什么呀？"
  },
  {
   "start": 262.161,
   "end": 264.032,
   "en": "Dinosaur!",
   "i": 79,
   "zh": "恐龙！"
  },
  {
   "start": 264.032,
   "end": 264.864,
   "en": "Grr!",
   "i": 80,
   "zh": "吼！"
  },
  {
   "start": 264.897,
   "end": 267.734,
   "en": "Oh, another dinosaur picture?",
   "i": 81,
   "zh": "哦，又画恐龙吗？"
  },
  {
   "start": 267.767,
   "end": 271.169,
   "en": "Well, maybe you can show us all how to paint a dinosaur!",
   "i": 82,
   "zh": "那不如你来教大家画恐龙吧！"
  },
  {
   "start": 271.203,
   "end": 274.407,
   "en": "Brilliant!",
   "i": 83,
   "zh": "太棒了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 274.44,
   "end": 275.183,
   "en": "Yes!",
   "i": 84,
   "zh": "好！"
  },
  {
   "start": 275.183,
   "end": 277.042,
   "en": "Brilliant!",
   "i": 85,
   "zh": "太棒了！"
  },
  {
   "start": 277.076,
   "end": 280.513,
   "en": "Brilliant!",
   "i": 86,
   "zh": "太棒了！"
  },
